{'symbol': 'ANSS', 'date': '2022-02-18 09:00:00', 'title': 'OPTICSTUDIO STAR MODULE FROM ZEMAX, AN ANSYS COMPANY, WINS COVETED SPIE PRISM AWARD IN SOFTWARE', 'text': 'PITTSBURGH, FEB. 18, 2022 /PRNEWSWIRE/ --\xa0 / KEY HIGHLIGHTS THE STAR MODULE OPTIMIZES WORKFLOWS BETWEEN OPTICSTUDIO AND FINITE ELEMENT ANALYSIS (FEA) PACKAGES DIRECTLY WITHIN OPTICSTUDIO, THE STAR MODULE CONVENIENTLY SIMPLIFIES FEA FILE IMPORT, STRUCTURAL AND THERMAL ANALYSIS, AND WORKFLOW AUTOMATION THE AWARD-WINNING MODULE STREAMLINES OPTICAL DESIGN, WHILE HELPING TO REDUCE DESIGN ERRORS, DEVELOPMENT TIME, AND MATERIAL COSTS ZEMAX, ACQUIRED BY ANSYS (NASDAQ: ANSS) IN 2021, RECEIVED THE HIGHLY ESTEEMED SPIE PRISM AWARD IN SOFTWARE FOR THE OPTICSTUDIO STAR MODULE. THE ANNUAL AWARDS RECOGNIZE THE LATEST AND GREATEST INNOVATION IN OPTICS AND PHOTONICS.'}